### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### mcp.http — MCP Tooling Contract (ADR-040)
### Validates the MCP tool-discovery and MCP-server listing endpoints respond.
### (Mutations — POST /servers/*, DELETE, POST /tools/{name}/execute — need fixtures
###  + teardown and live tool execution; cover them once the MCP stack is provisioned.)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Authenticate
# @name login
POST {{$dotenv ROUTER_URL}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_EMAIL}}",
  "password": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_PASSWORD}}"
}

?? status == 200

###

### List MCP Tools — discovery surface
# @name listMcpTools
GET {{$dotenv ROUTER_URL}}/api/v1/mcp/tools
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.token}}

?? status == 200

###

### List User MCP Servers
# @name listUserMcpServers
GET {{$dotenv ROUTER_URL}}/api/v1/mcp/servers/user
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.token}}

?? status == 200

###

### List Platform MCP Servers
# @name listPlatformMcpServers
GET {{$dotenv ROUTER_URL}}/api/v1/mcp/servers/platform
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.token}}

?? status == 200
